msgid ""
"Kamefu is now ready. \n"
"In a moment, your ROM collection will be built and Kamefu will show up.<br>\n"
"Thanks for using our program, and we hope that you will enjoy using it as "
"much as we enjoy coding it.\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><i>-The Kamefu development team.</i></p>"
